.freebuff/

# AI session memory: the internal risk register, the trademark discussion and the
# accepted-risk records. NOT source, and NOT for a public repository.
# This was missing until 2026-09-26, so `git add -A` would have published it —
# the same mistake as the Vercel upload that served /.workbuddy-ai/memory/MEMORY.md
# from the live site. Gitignored is not the same as not-committed; check this list
# before the first commit of any new top-level directory.
.workbuddy-ai/

